ary</a><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-all text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/tax-data\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-column h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg>Data</a><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-all text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/widgets\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg>Widgets</a></nav><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"hidden sm:flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-emerald-500 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/20 hover:shadow-emerald-500/30 transition-all hover:scale-[1.02]\" href=\"/paycheck-calculator\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-column h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg>Calculate Now</a><button data-slot=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transitio